00:56.360 --> 00:59.050
<b>Nyo.</b>

01:01.930 --> 01:03.990
<b>I wish a monster would appear
or something nyo.</b>

01:07.070 --> 01:08.430
<b>It's a monster!</b>

01:08.840 --> 01:10.960
<b>It's a monster!</b>

01:11.070 --> 01:13.010
<b>Part One: A Monster Attacks</b>

01:19.110 --> 01:21.810
<b>It's getting exciting nyo.</b>

01:21.920 --> 01:23.820
<b>It's quite a spectacle nyu.</b>

01:23.920 --> 01:24.880
<b>C'mon Dejiko!</b>

01:24.990 --> 01:27.580
<b>Fight the monster
and restore peace to the city gema.</b>

01:27.690 --> 01:28.990
<b>Nyo nyo!</b>

01:29.090 --> 01:32.990
<b>C'mon Dejiko!
Use your Laser Eye Beam!</b>

01:33.090 --> 01:38.000
<b>No, I don't think so.
I don't feel like it nyo.</b>

01:40.100 --> 01:44.430
<b>I knew it was stupid
to ask for your help.</b>

01:44.540 --> 01:48.000
<b>I guess it's up to the mega idol,
Rabi-en-Rose,</b>

01:48.110 --> 01:50.080
<b>to take down the monster.</b>

01:50.180 --> 01:52.040
<b>Wow, I'm the hero!</b>

01:55.650 --> 01:59.280
<b>She was all talk and no action nyo.</b>

01:59.390 --> 02:05.330
<b>I guess I should show that
I'm no ordinary cat-eared girl nyo.</b>

02:06.330 --> 02:08.230
<b>Right, Puchiko?</b>

02:08.330 --> 02:10.160
<b>Pui nyu!</b>

02:11.270 --> 02:15.790
<b>It's dangerous, but I'll get
a deadly weapon from my room nyo.</b>

02:19.040 --> 02:23.700
<b>I've turned the trash in these trash bags
into gas bombs nyo!</b>

02:23.810 --> 02:26.640
<b>I'm going to separate
the recyclable nyu.</b>

02:26.750 --> 02:29.110
<b>If you pour hot water
over the raw trash,</b>

02:29.220 --> 02:32.810
<b>and spray deodorant,
it smells even worse.</b>

02:36.220 --> 02:37.490
<b>Hello.</b>

02:37.590 --> 02:39.790
<b>I'm an alien from outer space.</b>

02:39.890 --> 02:41.830
<b>Part Two: An Alien Attacks, Too</b>

02:41.930 --> 02:43.790
<b>We don't have time
to deal with you now nyo!</b>

02:43.900 --> 02:45.830
<b>Part Three: A Big Battle</b>

02:46.630 --> 02:48.100
<b>Nyo!</b>

02:48.540 --> 02:51.330
<b>Have some curdled milk nyu!</b>

02:52.640 --> 02:55.130
<b>Look, we stopped it nyo.</b>

02:55.240 --> 02:56.800
<b>Time for the final attack gema.</b>

02:58.780 --> 03:00.840
<b>Laser Eye Beam!</b>

03:01.620 --> 03:02.840
<b>Nyo?</b>

03:02.950 --> 03:03.970
<b>Nyo!!</b>

03:04.080 --> 03:07.420
<b>Oh, no gema!
It's the end of the world gema!</b>

03:07.650 --> 03:08.350
<b>Nyo?</b>

03:08.460 --> 03:09.350
<b>Nyu?
Gema?</b>

03:09.460 --> 03:10.420
<b>Sign : Please feel free to take some</b>

03:10.520 --> 03:12.860
<b>Stop nyo!
It's dangerous gema!</b>

03:21.200 --> 03:22.460
<b>Nyo?</b>

03:29.840 --> 03:33.300
<b>Um, excuse me.</b>

03:35.220 --> 03:37.480
<b>How much is this?</b>

03:38.490 --> 03:39.850
<b>Well?</b>

